OL,2,V55555555CGCHQ DEATH
OL,3,Vu5u5u5u5CNOT SUICIDE - CORONER
OL,4,Q
OL,5, The East Sussex coroner has said he
OL,6, thinks GCHQ worker George Franks
OL,7, probably died of a heart attack and did
OL,8, not kill himself.
OL,9,Q
OL,10, Mr Edward Grace will open an inquest on
OL,11, Mr Franks, 58, a communications
OL,12, officer, in Hove tomorrow.
OL,13,Q
OL,14, A Commons question was asked about the
OL,15, possibility of him having killed
OL,16, himself because of pressures due to the
OL,17, union ban at GCHQ in Cheltenham.
OL,18,Q
OL,19, The coroner said: "This was a perfectly
OL,20, run-of-the-mill case. I think the whole
OL,21, thing has been prejudged."
OL,23,F]DFrom 09-04-84 / teletextarchive.com
