OL,2,V55555555CMORE PITS WORKING NORMALLY
OL,3,Vu5u5u5u5C
OL,4,Q
OL,5, The National Coal Board said 46 pits
OL,6, were working normally this morning -
OL,7, five more than Friday and the highest
OL,8, number since the miners' strike began.
OL,10, Welsh miners kept their promise to
OL,11, scale down picketing at Port Talbot,
OL,12, with only 40 men posted at the plant.
OL,14, Port Talbot has been the scene of some
OL,15, violence and many arrests and the
OL,16, scaling down was agreed with police to
OL,17, reduce tension.
OL,19, Fewer pickets have been on duty
OL,20, elsewhere in the coalfields. The NCB
OL,21, said all pits in Notts, Leics, S Derbys
OL,22, and Warwicks were producing coal.
OL,23,F]DFrom 09-04-84 / teletextarchive.com
OL,24,ANext PageBT'text FilesCRewindFReg Radio
