OL,2,V55555555CKINNOCK URGES BARCLAYS
OL,3,Vu5u5u5u5CTO END S AFRICAN LINKS
OL,5, Labour leader Neil Kinnock has urged
OL,6, Barclays Bank to end its links with
OL,7, South Africa and Namibia.
OL,8,B
OL,9, He claimed the bank's operations were
OL,10, "strengthening the white minority
OL,11, regime".
OL,12,B
OL,13, Mr Kinnock is a member of an anti-
OL,14, apartheid group which has formed a
OL,15, "Barclays shadow board".
OL,16,B
OL,17, The shadow board's report claims the
OL,18, bank helped finance arms exports from
OL,19, Britain to South Africa.
OL,20,B
OL,21, The bank was also closely linked with
OL,22, the Koeburg nuclear plant which could
OL,23, help South Africa develop the bomb.
OL,24,ANext PageBT'text FilesCRewindFReg Radio
