OL,2,V55555555CTHUGS STONE CITY'S
OL,3,Vu5u5u5u5CLIBERAL LEADER
OL,5, The leader of Liverpool's Liberals, Sir
OL,6, Trevor Jones, is recovering after being
OL,7, attacked by a gang of youths.
OL,9, Sir Trevor, 56, was loading a van
OL,10, behind his chandler's business when the
OL,11, youths approached him.
OL,13, "I heard these lads shouting 'Trevor
OL,14, Jones, Fascist' and there was a hail of
OL,15, stones," he said.
OL,17, Sir Trevor was treated in hospital and
OL,18, had four stitches inserted in a cut
OL,19, above the right eye.
OL,21, He has been prominent in opposing
OL,22, Labour's proposed budget which could
OL,23, put the city #190m in the red.
